                                                "sense_id": "1d53211f-feb7-3038-9f9a-6127a4663027",
                                                "text": "While a plain and direct Road is pav'd to their ὐψος, or sublime; no Track has been yet chalk'd out to arrive at our βάθος, or profund."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
